  "claim_boundary": "Current main b0c0c837 / tree 2963cb99 has now been measured on the typed, default-OFF BUILD_TESTING=OFF P40 v10 development artifact. Sustainable r3 is a complete strict BCCB integration-health result: all four cells are valid, candidate mean pure Prefill is 325.983493208 tok/s, baseline mean is 326.111753524 tok/s, and C/B is 0.9996066983. It passes the predeclared 0.99 matched-baseline floor but is not a speedup and does not reproduce the historical one-sample 392.804397421 tok/s max-clock observation. Max-GPU r4 and r5 are wholly invalid because over-current counters increased, despite temperatures remaining below 85C. Near-max GPU r6-r8 do not form a strict BCCB result because independent external CPU samples invalidate each bundle; four individually complete candidate cells have descriptive mean 375.956428659 tok/s, and three individually complete baseline cells have descriptive mean 375.935680902 tok/s, for descriptive C/B 1.00005519. That cross-bundle aggregation is descriptive only and grants no performance decision. The one-output-token workload has no Decode transition. The route remains T3 development integration health only, default-OFF, accuracy-unqualified, non-release, non-production, and ineligible to resume paused P3 optimization.",
